type: software
title: "Reproducibility package for non-intrusive load monitoring in industrial three-phase multi-source systems"
abstract: >
  Complete computational pipeline (29 canonical stages, shared module and 15 auxiliary
  scripts), trained models and per-window predictions of the article "Scale-admissibility
  gate for non-intrusive load monitoring in three-phase industrial energy systems with an
  unmeasured support source" (Applied Energy).
